    "bio": "A Representative from Florida; born in Washington, D.C., April 16, 1941; attended Hearst Elementary School, 1946-1952; graduated from Woodrow Wilson High School, Washington, D.C., 1959; B.S., George Washington University, Washington, D.C., 1963; attended the University of California, Los Angeles, Calif., 1965; United States Air Force, 1963-1967; businessman; elected as a Republican to the One Hundred First and to the eleven succeeding Congresses (January 3, 1989-January 3, 2013); unsuccessful candidate for nomination to the One Hundred Thirteenth Congress in 2012.",
